{"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Iterates the members of this family in batches, giving "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"body"},{"type":"text","text":" the components of a batch as contiguous spans."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"forEachComponentSpan","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"R1","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W1","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"reading","kind":"externalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"rType1","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"R1"},{"kind":"text","text":".Type, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"writing"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"wType1"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"W1"},{"text":".Type, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"body"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Span","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4SpanV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"text":"R1","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"inout","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s11MutableSpanV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MutableSpan"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"W1"},{"text":">) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Void","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"keyword","text":"rethrows"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"R1"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Component","preciseIdentifier":"s:12FirebladeECS9ComponentP","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Component"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"W1"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Component","preciseIdentifier":"s:12FirebladeECS9ComponentP","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Component"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ReadingAndWritingComponents","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ChoosingAStorage","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/MigratingToFirebladeECS2"]},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Reads 1 and writes 1 component type: ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"body"},{"text":" receives a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Span"},{"text":" of the read type and an ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"inout"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MutableSpan"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of the written type. Within one call all spans have the same count and the same order: element ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"i"},{"text":" of every","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"span belongs to the same member. The batches visit every member exactly once, in the iteration order of the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"family."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["movers.forEachComponentSpan(reading: Velocity.self, writing: Position.self) { velocities, positions in","    for i in positions.indices { positions[i].x += velocities[i].dx }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Batches","text":"Batches","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The sparse-set storage keeps every component type in its own dense array, so the components of the members of a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"family are not necessarily next to each other in all arrays. The spans view the storage itself and nothing is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"copied or allocated, so a batch is a maximal run of members whose components are consecutive in every involved"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"array. Entities that were created together and never had components removed form one big batch; after"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"churn (removing components swap-removes) the batches get shorter, down to 1 element per call in the worst case.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Write ","type":"text"},{"code":"body","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" so that it is correct for any batch size, and do not rely on the number of calls.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The archetype storage keeps the columns of a table aligned, so it passes exactly one batch per table that matches","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the family and has members, in table creation order. Entities with the same component set form one batch, however"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the component set came about, and a family whose members have several component sets gets several calls.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Rules","anchor":"Rules","type":"heading","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every type must be a required component of the family. The spans cannot escape "},{"code":"body","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" ("},{"code":"Span","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"code":"~Escapable","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"While the pass runs the nexus is locked like in "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Family\/forEach(reading:writing:_:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":": structural changes, reading a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"written type through the nexus, writing a type twice, and writing a type that is read (or reading a written"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"type) stop the process with a message."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A delegate subscribed to "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEventMask\/valueChanges"},{"type":"text","text":" receives one "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentsModified"},{"type":"text","text":" per written type"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and call, not one event per batch."}]},{"style":"note","name":"Complexity","type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O(N) where N is the number of members, plus one hash lookup per component type."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/family\/foreachcomponentspan(reading:writing:_:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Family"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Family\/forEachComponentSpan(reading:writing:_:)"},"metadata":{"conformance":{"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}],"conformancePrefix":[{"text":"Conforms when","type":"text"}],"constraints":[{"code":"each C","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" conforms to ","type":"text"},{"code":"Component","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},"platforms":[{"introducedAt":"26.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"name":"iOS","unavailable":false},{"introducedAt":"26.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"name":"m